# Dantooine, the Enclave courtyard and the sublevel (TSL, 605DAN, 610DAN):
# by the east way into the courtyard, Daraala at the salvagers' camp (just
# visiting, on to the ruins: her two dead salvagers to find), the Enclave's
# ruin seen, Taepalae's salvagers out of the Enclave (no fight); in the
# sublevel, the laigreks round Jorran's room fought and Jorran let out (told
# truly they are dead, sent off to the camp: DSimpson's light way), the
# first dead salvager, the stuck door struck open, the library's security
# door (Bao-Dur's Security), the Disciple asked through, the dead
# mercenaries' datapad (Azkul's orders for Vrook), the second salvager's
# will left as it is, Gerevick's ambush at the fountain fought; at the camp
# Jorran paid his 500 for Suulru's modulator and 1000 for his Jedi finds
# (the emitter's and the energy cell's fixtures). Starts from the cave's
# checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @dantooine_rewards data/routes/tsl/dantooine_enclave.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "The Enclave Courtyard Area" and "Enclave
# Sublevel" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: Ralon's holocron (both light ways ask Awareness 4 to see it is
# fake: a_ralo_dialogue), Nallek's fight, the protocol droids and the
# conduits (Repair parts and spikes), the storage room's overload.
exit To_605@1        # the courtyard's east way, by the mercenaries' camp
module 605dan
say I'm just visiting. # Daraala: her dead salvagers
say Why don't you think I will find anything?
say Surely there's something left.
say Why won't anyone help me?
say I'm going to the ruins.
say I'll be going now.
use npc_daraala
talk
to tr_enclave_cam    # the Enclave's ruin
talk
to tr_taep_conv      # Taepalae's salvagers leave the Enclave
talk
exit To_610
module 610dan
to wp_jorr_pc        # Jorran's room: its laigreks fought first
fight 40
say The laigreks in this area are dead.
say Leave quickly before more # Jorran sent to the camp
use jorr_door
talk
use sal_corpse1@2    # the first dead salvager
bash Enclave_Door_Stuck@1 # the stuck door on the way round
leader 1             # the library's security door (DC 28): Bao-Dur's
unlock Enclave_Security_Door # Security
leader player
to tr_disciple       # the Disciple, asked through
talk
use deadmerc_cont    # the dead mercenaries' datapad: Vrook to the cave
say Don't change the will. # the second salvager's will
use sal_corpse1@1
to tr_gere_talk      # Gerevick's ambush at the fountain
talk
fight 40
exit To_605
module 605dan
say I'm here about Suulru's moisture vaporator. # Jorran at the camp
say I don't care. Just give me the modulator.
say Fine, here's 500 credits.
use npc_jorran
talk
say How much do you want for the Jedi artifacts? # and his finds
say Here's 1000 credits.
use npc_jorran
talk
save dantooine_camp
